  "description": "The G4.WebDriver.Remote.Chrome package is a powerful integration for Chrome WebDriver within the G4™ ecosystem and beyond. Seamlessly connecting with the Chrome browser, this package facilitates remote communication over the WebDriver protocol, offering a reliable and feature-rich solution for web automation scenarios. Whether you are working within the G4™ framework or any other automation environment, leverage the capabilities of Chrome WebDriver remotely for efficient and robust browser automation.",
